== 5. Data Flow

=== 5.1 Page Request Flow

```
1. HTTP Request → Web Server
2. Web Server → PHP-FPM
3. PHP → MediaWiki
4. MediaWiki → Parser
5. Parser → SMW (semantic data)
6. SMW → Database
7. Database → SMW
8. SMW → Parser
9. Parser → HTML
10. HTML → Web Server
11. Web Server → Client
```

=== 5.2 Edit Flow

```
1. User submits edit
2. MediaWiki validates
3. SMW extracts properties
4. SMW updates triples
5. Database stores revision
6. Cache invalidated
7. Search index updated
8. Webhooks triggered
```

=== 5.3 Query Flow

```
1. Parse {{#ask: query}}
2. Generate SQL
3. Check cache
4. Execute query
5. Format results
6. Cache results
7. Return HTML
```

