== 7. Security

=== 7.1 Authentication

'''Methods:'''
* Local accounts
* OAuth (Google, GitHub)
* LDAP (enterprise)
* API keys

'''Configuration:'''
```php
$wgGroupPermissions['*']['createaccount'] = false;
$wgGroupPermissions['*']['edit'] = false;
$wgGroupPermissions['user']['edit'] = true;
```

=== 7.2 Authorization

'''Roles:'''
* Anonymous (read-only)
* User (edit)
* Steward (review)
* Admin (configure)
* BITCORE (governance)

'''Permissions:'''
```php
$wgGroupPermissions['steward']['validate'] = true;
$wgGroupPermissions['steward']['epistemic-review'] = true;
```

=== 7.3 Data Protection

'''Encryption:'''
* TLS 1.3 for transport
* Database encryption at rest
* API key hashing

'''Privacy:'''
* GDPR compliance
* Data retention policies
* User data export

